    {
      "id": "TVBroadcast_Text_BattlingTrainers_Farewell",
      "en_US": [
        "MC: I hope you enjoyed this\n",
        "showing of Battling Trainers.\r",
        "Until the next broadcast...\n",
        "Good-bye, and good battling!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Animateur: J’espère que vous \n",
        "avez apprécié ce numéro de\f",
        "Dresseurs en Action.\r",
        "En attendant le prochain...\n",
        "Au revoir et... combattez bien!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TVBroadcast_Text_BattlingTrainers_FarewellExtended",
      "en_US": [
        "MC: On Battling Trainers, we’re\n",
        "always on the hunt for news.\r",
        "Our interviewers have scattered\n",
        "throughout Sinnoh.\r",
        "We look forward to hearing about\n",
        "you, Trainers!\r",
        "That’s all the time we have today!\n",
        "Good-bye, and good battling!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Animateur: Dans Dresseurs en Action,\n",
        "nous cherchons toujours la nouveauté.\r",
        "Nos journalistes sont dispersés dans\n",
        "tout Sinnoh.\r",
        "Nous espérons vous revoir très\n",
        "bientôt, Dresseurs!\r",
        "C’est tout pour aujourd’hui!\n",
        "Au revoir et... combattez bien!"
      ]
    },
